            "text": "Investigating the production payments incident. I will reply with a JSON object containing the hypothesis, confidence level, affected files, and evidence.\n\nThe root cause is a race condition in payments/store.py. When the gateway times out, the code returns a 504 error before storing the idempotency record. The payment remains authorized, so a retry debits the customer again.",
